id: blinded
name: Blinded
kind: condition
description: >
  For one reason or another, you cannot see for a short period.
text: >
  While you have this Combat Condition, suffer from the effects of the
  Blinding Light Level (see - Light Levels), regardless of what the current
  Light Level is.

---

# The Blinding Light Level halves Awareness, Defense Value and the Perception
# Skill Bonus. Written out rather than referenced, because a Light Level is a
# property of a Square and this Condition ignores what the Square says.

[passive]
awareness *= 0.5;
defenseValue *= 0.5;
skill.perception.bonus *= 0.5;
